# ST10 (generalization): ST9 recipe (OPPCH 0.55 + ENT 0.016 + ST4/ST5/ST6 frozen
# finals in EXTRA_OPPS) with two changes: add ST7_final (best mid chunk) to the
# league at w1.0 so the policy also faces the newest entropy-bumped style, and
# add Megabyte at w2.0 (SubparN0va/ByteBotpack) as a public bot very good at
# dodging air-dribble bumps. Galactus stays 2.5, flip_reset 70. From ST9 best chunk.
# Hypothesis: after ST8/ST9 broaden recent gens + league fraction, folding in
# ST7 + Megabyte keeps the panel diverse across playstyles without overweighting
# any single opponent. Megabyte weight 2.0 matches Galactus's profile.
GAMMA=0.998; TPI=300_000; MB=100_000; LR=5e-5; ENT=0.016; OPPCH=0.55; HOLDREL=600000000; DECAY=400_000_000; MINLR=0.4
